{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 51, :comments ["<b>אשר יריתי,</b> it and its brothers [i.e., the related nouns] are from the root of \"יָרָה בַיָּם\" (Exodus 4:15), and the hands toward one place:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {0 "The cited form ירה בים does not appear in Exodus 4:15; the verse has והוריתי, translated literally as written."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:41.970358842Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}